# Peragus, the mining tunnels (TSL, 101PER's hatch to 102PER): Atton on the
# open hatch (the Jedi's sacrifice, LSP), the supply barrel's miner's
# outfit, the droids, the containment console's fields shut down, and on
# to the fuel depot. Starts from T3's checkpoint, the Exile back in command:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_hatch data/routes/tsl/peragus_tunnels.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Our Hero" and "Peragus Mining Tunnels",
# GameBanshee's Mining Tunnels (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
say A Jedi's life is sacrifice # Atton on the hatch T3 opened: LSP
talk
exit To_102PER       # through the emergency hatch, into the tunnels
use MilLowPlstcCylin # the supply barrel: miner's uniform, survey gear,
                     # Telos mining shield, safety harness, medpac
equip                # (Atton's comm on the way in: advice only)
use LowBroknDrd@3    # the broken droids by the first fuel pump
                     # (the second dead end's droid stays behind its sealed door)
fight 30             # up the last hallway past the damaged mining droid
                     # and through the cave's droids
say access fuel containment functions # the containment console: the
say shut down containment fields # fields down, the way out open
say log out
use Shftcom
fight 30             # the spider droids behind the fields
exit Door_To_103PER  # the far exit: the fuel depot's maintenance level
save peragus_depot
